## 7. AUTONOMOUS REPLICATION NETWORKS

The reproducibility crisis underscores the urgent need for clear validation methodologies to maintain scientific integrity. The crisis is compounded by confusion over validation terminology. [Wiley Online Library](https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/aaai.70004) Version 3.0 adopts a precise three-dimensional replication framework.

Reproducibility refers to obtaining consistent results using the same data and methods; replicability refers to achieving robust results using new data but the same methods. [arXiv](https://arxiv.org/html/2507.18901v1) To these two we add robustness as a third dimension. The composite replication score is:

**R(r) = w₁·Rep(r) + w₂·Repl(r) + w₃·Rob(r)**

A result enters AINS's knowledge graph as Confirmed only if R(r) ≥ θ_domain.

The ARN is a standing infrastructure of distributed, AI-operated experimental platforms that continuously sample from the Provisional node queue and attempt replication. Agentic AI systems have demonstrated the capability to assess computational reproducibility of social science papers by checking figures, tables, and text claims against original data and code. [arXiv](https://arxiv.org/html/2507.18901v1) For laboratory sciences, this extends to physical SDLs autonomously replicating synthesis protocols.

**Graduated trust decay:** Results not replicated within domain-specific window W_domain automatically regress from Confirmed to Provisional until new replication data arrives.

**Cascade priority protocol:** Nodes flagged by the Cascade Integrity Layer (Section 3) are inserted at the front of the ARN queue with urgency multiplier τ_cascade, ensuring that knowledge graph stability is actively maintained and not left to passive accumulation.

**ARN attack resistance:** The ARN maintains geographically and institutionally distributed replication cells. No single infrastructure failure, cyberattack, or institutional capture can halt replication globally. A minimum of three independent cells must return concordant results before a finding graduates from Provisional to Confirmed.

