Design the **graceful non-participant protocol:** institutions that refuse to join AINS are not excluded from contributing to G(t). Their published results are accepted as input nodes but flagged as low-confidence External Provisional until independently replicated by an ARN cell. This prevents a catastrophic science schism between AINS-member and non-member institutions while maintaining quality distinctions.

